ull,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"folder":"7cyoYPoPYA01mErU","img":"icons/magic/control/encase-creature-spider-hold.webp","name":"Nightmare (Targeting Creator Only)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You send disturbing nightmares to your target. The next time the target falls asleep, it must attempt a Will save. If you know the target only by name and have never met them, the target gets a +4 circumstance bonus to the Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target suffers no adverse effects and is temporarily immune for 1 week.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target experiences the nightmares but suffers no adverse effects other than unpleasant memories.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target experiences the nightmares and awakens @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.HL2l2VRSaQHu9lUw]{Fatigued}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target experiences the nightmares, awakens Fatigued, and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 2} until it is no longer Fatigued.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"nightmare","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","illusion","manipulate","mental"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":4},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature you know by name"},"range":{"value":"planetary"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"10 minutes"},"duration":{"value":"1 day","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":{"save":{"basic":false,"statistic":"will"}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"qdqbkWkVdfT4Vr1Q"},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Uqj344bezBq3ESdq","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"sKoX2payQFIpKina"},{"folder":"T8AzYUgNIAgTJ9Iz","img":"icons/magic/unholy/strike-beam-blood-small-red-purple.webp","name":"Phantom Pain","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Illusory pain wracks the target, dealing 2d4 mental damage and @Damage[(@item.level)d4[persistent,mental]] damage. The target must attempt a Will save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes full initial damage but no persistent damage, and the spell ends immediately.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes full initial and persistent damage, and the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1}. If the target recovers from being Sickened, the persistent damage ends and the spell ends.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 2}.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d4 and the persistent damage by 1d4.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"phantom-pain","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","illusion","manipulate","mental","nonlethal"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"1 minute","sustained":false},"damage":{"0":{"applyMod":false,"category":null,"formula":"2d4","kinds":["damage"],"materials":[],"type":"mental"}},"defense":{"save":{"basic":false,"statistic":"will"}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"qdqbkWkVdfT4Vr1Q","heightenedLevel":2},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"damage":{"0":"2d4"},"interval":1,"type":"interval"}},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.R8bqnYiThB6MYTxD","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"KSaZKUmmNBWt9okK"},{"folder":"D7UVaOiB40wTR6kv","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/message.webp","name":"Message","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You mouth words quietly, but instead of coming out of your mouth, they're transferred directly to the ears of the target. While others can't hear your words any better than if you normally mouthed them, the target can hear your words as if they were standing next to you. The target can give a brief response as a reaction, or as a free action on their next turn if they wish, but they must be able to see you and be within range to do so. If they respond, their response is delivered directly to your ear, just like the original message.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The spell's range increases to 500 feet.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"message","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["auditory","cantrip","concentrate","illusion","linguistic","mental","subtle"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"1"},"duration":{"value":"see below","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"qdqbkWkVdfT4Vr1Q"},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"levels":{"3":{"range":{"value":"500 feet"}}},"type":"fixed"}},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.vLzFcIaSXs7YTIqJ","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"9yVl4hKQMrMx2C8d"},{"folder":"D7UVaOiB40wTR6kv","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/mage-hand.webp","name":"Telekinetic Hand","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You create a floating, magical hand, either invisible or ghostlike, that grasps the target object and levitates it slowly up to 20 feet in any direction. When you Sustain the spell, you can move the object an additional 20 feet. If the object is in the air when the spell ends, the object falls.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 1 or less.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet, and you can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 1 or less.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet, and you can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 2 or less.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"telekinetic-hand","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 unattended object of light Bulk or less"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":true},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"qdqbkWkVdfT4Vr1Q"},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"levels":{"3":{"target":{"value":"1 unattended object with a Bulk of 1 or less"}},"5":{"range":{"value":"60 feet"}},"7":{"target":{"value":"1 unattended object with a Bulk of 2 or less"}}},"type":"fixed"}},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.pwzdSlJgYqN7bs2w","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"6LsbvUCHcxNuzSSQ"},{"folder":"D7UVaOiB40wTR6kv","img":"icons/skills/ranged/bullets-triple-ball-yellow.webp","name":"Telekinetic Projectile","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You hurl a loose, unattended object that is within range and that has 1 Bulk or less at the target. Make a spell attack roll against the target. If you hit, you deal 2d6 bludgeoning, piercing, or slashing damage—as appropriate for the object you hurled. No specific traits or magic properties of the hurled item affect the attack or the damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> You deal double damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> You deal full damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"telekinetic-projectile","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["attack","cantrip","concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{"0":{"applyMod":false,"category":null,"formula":"2d6","kinds":["damage"],"materials":[],"type":"untyped"}},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"qdqbkWkVdfT4Vr1Q"},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"damage":{"0":"1d6"},"interval":1,"type":"interval"},"overlays":{"2I469pfbYcmFvzOA":{"_id":"2I469pfbYcmFvzOA","name":"Telekinetic Projectile (Bludgeoning)","overlayType":"override","sort":1,"system":{"damage":{"0":{"category":null,"type":"bludgeoning"}}}},"cUFX7ExSLeoa3vIF":{"_id":"cUFX7ExSLeoa3vIF","name":"Telekinetic Projectile (Piercing)","overlayType":"override","sort":2,"system":{"damage":{"0":{"category":null,"type":"piercing"}}}},"zFWsMjoeCnLxqJaV":{"_id":"zFWsMjoeCnLxqJaV","name":"Telekinetic Projectile (Slashing)","overlayType":"override","sort":3,"system":{"damage":{"0":{"category":null,"type":"slashing"}}}}}},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.60sgbuMWN0268dB7","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"0v4zcNm7VN6Cu0FA"},{"type":"action","name":"Creator's Memories","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>The hand gains a +2 circumstance bonus to Perception checks when it @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{Seeks} its creator, to Survival checks when it @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.EA5vuSgJfiHH7plD]{Tracks} its creator, and to damage rolls when it Strikes its creator.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","option":"creators-memories","toggleable":true},{"key":"FlatModifier","selector":["perception","survival","strike-damage"],"value":2,"type":"circumstance","predicate":["creators-memories"]}],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.4.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"interaction","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"OMjgXmTwIXp9elMc","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Scramble","system":{"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The treacherous telekinetic hand is targeted by a melee attack by an attacker it can see</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The treacherous telekinetic hand gains a +2 circumstance bonus to AC against the triggering attack. After the attack resolves, the hand Strides, Climbs, or Flies up to 10 feet.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","option":"scramble","toggleable":true},{"key":"FlatModifier","selector":"ac","value":2,"type":"circumstance","predicate":["scramble"]}],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.4.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"yuovar8xKRn4f1ba","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"img":"icons/equipment/finger/ring-band-engraved-scrolls-bronze.webp","name":"Ring of Sigils","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>This silver band is carved with the personal sigils of different individuals, adding one to represent you when you invest it. The ring allows you to cast @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.AUctDF2fqPZN2w4W]{Sigil} as an arcane innate cantrip.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Activate—Track Sigil</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> (concentrate, detection)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per 10 minutes</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You detect the general direction toward the most recent <em>sigil</em> you created using the ring. This activation fails if the <em>sigil</em> is more than 5 miles away or if there's lead or running water between you and the <em>sigil</em>.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"ring-of-sigils","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["arcane","i